00:13.000 --> 00:18.000 line:16 position:50% size:80% align:middle
Espresso martini, blood orange Mai Tai, mint mojito, and so many others that you guys are just gonna have to try for yourselves.

00:18.000 --> 00:21.000 line:16 position:50% size:80% align:middle
